# The build context of control-plane, memory-service and notification-service is the
# umbrella root: platform-auth-sdk (and the core client) are path dependencies in a
# neighbouring directory. Everything the build does not need is excluded here.
# memory-service overrides this file with its own memory-service/Dockerfile.dockerignore.
**/.git
**/.venv
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.secrets
**/*.zip
secrets/
deploy/
tools/
guide/
cla/
.claude/
.github/
*/docs/
*/tests/
memory-service/*
!memory-service/client
iam-service/
